      "id": "substitution-threat",
      "title": "The Model Substitution Problem: Economic Incentives Drive Covert Swaps",
      "objective": "Explain the core problem: providers may replace advertised models with quantized, smaller, or different models to cut costs. Show the four substitution types (smaller model, quantized variant, fine-tuned version, different family) in a structured diagram or list. Reference the formal hypothesis testing framework (H0 vs H1)."
